[00:00.00] 作曲 : Benson Boone/Jack LaFrantz/Jason Evigan
[00:00.00][by:stillworkingonit]
[00:20.37]When you pull me in
[00:20.37]你拉近与我的距离
[00:22.18]And you hold me close
[00:22.18]紧紧拥我入怀
[00:24.05]And you say all kinds of crazy things
[00:24.05]说着那些疯狂话语
[00:26.18]That make me wanna stay in your arms
[00:26.18]让我甘愿沉溺在你臂弯
[00:29.13]You're a charm
[00:29.13]你是致命诱惑
[00:30.90]I'm in love
[00:30.90]我已深陷爱河
[00:33.09]But you don't care when I'm falling down
[00:33.09]可当我坠落时你却视而不见
[00:36.08]Slowly burning out
[00:36.08]冷眼旁观我燃烧煎熬
[00:37.83]And the lights and crowds and cameras
[00:37.83]闪光灯 人群 镜头
[00:39.76]And my bass are getting louder
[00:39.76]还有越来越躁动的贝斯声
[00:41.63]And I need some time
[00:41.63]我需要喘息空间
[00:44.75]You say why
[00:44.75]你却质问缘由
[00:46.73]
[00:47.20]Don't you see that lately
[00:47.20]难道你没发现
[00:51.61]I've been fading?
[00:51.61]我渐渐消逝的身影
[00:55.06]I can't breathe inside this cage
[00:55.06]在这牢笼里快要窒息
[01:00.14]
[01:01.06]You took the man in me
[01:01.06]你夺走了真实的我
[01:04.59]You took his sanity
[01:04.59]摧毁了他的理智
[01:08.07]You stole the last of any light inside his eyes
[01:08.07]偷走他眼中最后一丝光芒
[01:15.09]You really make me bleed
[01:15.09]你让我遍体鳞伤
[01:18.45]Blood on these ivory keys
[01:18.45]象牙琴键上血迹斑斑
[01:22.02]You killed the only part of me I ever liked
[01:22.02]扼杀我曾最珍视的那个自己
[01:28.97]You took the man in me
[01:28.97]你夺走了真实的我
[01:32.43]Where is the man in me?
[01:32.43]那个真正的我去了哪里
[01:35.60]
[01:37.05]Unbelievable, unforgivable
[01:37.05]不可置信 不可饶恕
[01:40.42]How you promise me the world, and when I turned around you ripped it away
[01:40.42]向我许诺全世界后 转身你就撕碎前言
[01:45.71]Everything was a game
[01:45.71]一切只是场游戏
[01:49.56]And you don't need any sympathy
[01:49.56]你不需要任何怜悯
[01:52.43]Any more energy
[01:52.43]也不值得我再费心力
[01:54.16]Nor have I ever had better reasons for leaving
[01:54.16]从未有过如此充分的理由离开
[01:56.98]Something so displeasing even the sweetest words
[01:56.98]这般令人作呕的存在 再甜蜜的誓言
[01:59.67]They were treason 'cause you just lied to my face
[01:59.67]都是背叛 毕竟你面不改色就撒了谎
